<title>EGYPT: Egypt overnight, one-week interbank rates steady.</title>
<headline>Egypt overnight, one-week interbank rates steady.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egyptian pound overnight interbank rates were steady on Monday in a liquid private sector market at between 10-1/4 and 10-3/8 percent.</p>
<p>One-week rates on the pound were also steady, ranging between 10-3/8 and 10-7/16 percent in a slightly tight market.</p>
<p>Public-sector banks maintained their minimum overnight lending rate at 10-1/2 percent.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/91</p>
